<LegalLayout locale="en" title="Privacy Policy" description="How DoctorConverter handles uploaded files: temporary storage, automatic deletion, session-only access and minimal technical data.">
  <p>DoctorConverter (<strong>doctorconverter.com</strong>) is built to process your documents and then forget them. This policy explains what happens to your files and data.</p>
  <h2>1. Temporary storage only</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Automatic expiry:</strong> Uploaded files and results are kept for a limited retention period (60 minutes by default) and are then deleted automatically.</li>
    <li><strong>Delete any time:</strong> The “Delete files” button closes access immediately; physical deletion follows in the background after a short grace period.</li>
    <li><strong>No content review:</strong> We do not read your documents, share them or use them to train AI models.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>No account data:</strong> No sign-up, so we never ask for your name, email or phone number.</li>
    <li><strong>Session cookie:</strong> A signed, anonymous session cookie links your uploads to your browser so nobody else can access them. It expires after 24 hours.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> Standard request logs and a keyed hash of your network address are used for rate limiting and abuse prevention. File names and contents are not stored in metadata or logs.</li>
    <li><strong>Visit statistics:</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which sets no cookies and builds no personal profiles, to count page views and measure speed. File contents and names are never part of it.</li>
    <li><strong>Language preference:</strong> If you switch language, your choice is stored in your browser’s local storage.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>3. Transfer security</h2>
  <p>All traffic between your browser and our servers is encrypted with HTTPS (TLS).</p>
  <h2>4. Third parties</h2>
  <p>We do not sell or share your files or metadata with advertisers or data brokers. Hosting and network providers process traffic only to deliver the service.</p>
  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy? Email <a href="mailto:destek@doctorconverter.com" class="text-accent underline">destek@doctorconverter.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
